    <item>
      <title>Starting porridge</title>
      <link>https://example.github.io/my-blog/2026/11/18/#a174010</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://example.github.io/my-blog/2026/11/18/#a174010</guid>
      <pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 17:40:10 GMT</pubDate>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;This entry has children, so its text is the &lt;strong&gt;title&lt;/strong&gt; and the children are the body. The title links to &lt;a href=&quot;https://example.github.io/my-blog/2026/11/18/#a174010&quot;&gt;the permalink&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;figure&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://example.github.io/my-blog/images/2026/11/porridge.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;A bowl of porridge&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;caption&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;A bowl of porridge&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A body node with list=&amp;quot;bullets&amp;quot; becomes a paragraph followed by a list:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oats&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Milk, or water if you're &lt;em&gt;brave&lt;/em&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lists nest as deep as the outline does&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Golden syrup&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Inline HTML is allowed: &lt;mark&gt;highlighted&lt;/mark&gt;, and so are autolinks like &lt;a href=&quot;https://example.com&quot;&gt;https://example.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A line under a line, without list=&amp;quot;bullets&amp;quot;, is just another paragraph.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;blockquote class=&quot;quote&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A quote inside a post, with no source.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=C-TY_XSMboY&amp;amp;t=90s&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i.ytimg.com/vi/C-TY_XSMboY/hqdefault.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;YouTube video&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A YouTube address mid-sentence, https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6NzAn238PPE, stays text.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
